        "body": "Hut 8 Corp. is a public company headquartered in Miami, Florida, trading under the ticker HUT and registered with the SEC under CIK 0001964789. On its own site the company describes itself as owning, operating, and scaling purpose-built businesses that acquire, deploy, and monetize specialized hardware for next-generation, energy-intensive technologies. Through that portfolio, it says, it offers direct exposure to markets created by transformative technologies such as AI and Bitcoin mining.\n\nThe site's most specific AI claim is the full commercialization of the 1 GW Beacon Point AI Data Center Campus, which it says was completed with a second 352 MW IT lease. Hut 8 states that this brings campus-level base-term contract value to $19.6 billion.\n\nThe company's law exposure is recorded in Florida, with a count of 69, and no lawsuits are listed against it.",
